. I wouldn't bring a laptop and spend the day here, as it is perhaps too cozy for that, but great to grab a table outside and enjoy the morning breeze with a pastry. The menu has coffee, espresso, and several other kinds of drinks you need to get your day started right. Great staff, delicious iced lattes, and lots of open air. I look forward to coming back."},{"business_id":"0liks45enqVRV3_ORP2wng","review_id":"NNqjoLtKv137kgMqIGQubg","date":"2016-03-01T03:37:44","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9261606931686401,"text_excerpt":"Charming coffee take out with a few tables out front. Within easy walking distance from The Hampton Inn and other St Charles addresses. I got my daily iced mochas here and was happy to find this spot."}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
